OL,3,GNEWSAAttorney General approval required
OL,4,Afor serious Troubles prosecutions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Attorney General must provide
OL,7,Fconsent for any serious prosecutions
OL,8,Frelated to the Troubles in Northern
OL,9,FIreland, under changes to the
OL,10,Fgovernment's planned legislation.
OL,12,FIt is among a series of amendments the
OL,13,Fgovernment has tabled for its bill,
OL,14,Fwhich seeks to deal with the unresolved
OL,15,Flegacy of the decades-long violent
OL,16,Fconflict.
OL,18,FThe bill was first introduced to
OL,19,FParliament last year following
OL,20,Fagreement on a joint framework with the
OL,21,FIrish government.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
