OL,3,GNEWSAAttorney General approval required
OL,4,Afor serious Troubles prosecutions
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant said the amendments give
OL,8,F"robust, permanent safeguards" to
OL,9,Fensure former soldiers and police
OL,10,Fofficers are treated with "fairness,
OL,11,Fdignity and respect".
